sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Patient / Caller
    participant Mic as Browser Web Audio API
    participant WS as Voice Gateway (WebSockets)
    participant VAD as VAD & Barge-in Detector
    participant VoiceAdapter as «interface» VoiceProvider
    participant Agent as AI Agent Orchestrator

    Note over Caller,Agent: Turn 1: Normal Audio Stream & Synthesis
    Caller->>Mic: Speaks: "مساء الخير، عايز أعرف مواعيد العيادة"
    Mic->>WS: Stream Binary PCM Audio Chunks (20ms frames)
    WS->>VAD: Detect speech onset & offset
    VAD->>VoiceAdapter: Process Audio Stream (STT / Realtime Candidate)
    VoiceAdapter->>Agent: Emits Transcript: "مساء الخير، عايز أعرف مواعيد العيادة"

    Agent->>VoiceAdapter: Request Speech Synthesis for Reply
    VoiceAdapter-->>WS: Stream Synthesized Audio Chunks
    WS-->>Mic: Stream Outbound Audio Playback
    Mic-->>Caller: "مساء النور يا فندم! عيادتنا بتفتح كل يوم من..."

    Note over Caller,Agent: Turn 2: User Interruption (Barge-in Cutoff)
    Caller->>Mic: Interrupts: "تمام شكراً، عايز دكتور جلدية"
    Mic->>WS: New Inbound Audio Chunks
    WS->>VAD: Detect Inbound Speech while Playback Active!

    critical Immediate Barge-in Truncation (< 50ms)
        VAD->>WS: EMIT EVENT: INTERRUPT_DETECTED
        WS->>WS: Truncate outbound audio playback queue immediately
        WS-->>Mic: Flush client audio playback buffer (Silence output)
        VAD->>VoiceAdapter: Cancel active TTS synthesis stream
        VAD->>Agent: Notify barge-in & supply new inbound transcript
    end

    Note over Caller: Assistant instantly stops speaking.<br/>Listens attentively to new user turn.
    VoiceAdapter->>Agent: New Transcript: "تمام شكراً، عايز دكتور جلدية"
    Agent->>VoiceAdapter: Synthesize response for Dermatology doctor request
    VoiceAdapter-->>WS: New Audio Stream
    WS-->>Mic: Playback
    Mic-->>Caller: "أهلاً بحضرتك، عندنا استشاري الجلدية دكتور..."
